  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eastern Cape Flood Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eastern Cape communities have suffered the effects of severe rains over the period of 08 - 11 February 2023. Among those worst affected are families who lost their mud homes and all their belongings that were washed away during the flooding. Gift of the Givers responded to these families with emergency relief aid providing meals and blankets at their place of refuge. We&apos;ve commenced our long-term intervention that entails the rebuilding of homes and infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
